    rdfs:label "Zartepa";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/971705%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Bactrian walled settlement in Southern Uzbekistan that had a walled citadel and a palace within and probably had a moat outside. The settlement also had a Buddhist sanctuary. The site dates from the 4th-2nd centuries BCE and was occupied until the 5th-7th centuries CE.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/807181365> .

