    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/651820395%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "An ancient estuary cataloged by Ptolemy. BAtlas was only confident enough to locate it somewhere in modern Somerset, listing it as an \"unlocated\" feature in the Map-by-Map Directory. Other scholarly suggestions include the Axe and the Parrett rivers.";
