<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/846526213/representative-location-of-the-kidmuri-temple> dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jnovotny>;
    dcterms:description "The representative location of the Kidmuri temple at Kalhu is based on the visible remains of the (partially) excavated Šarrat-niphi temple and those of the Northwest palace. The nineteenth-century excavation pit can no longer be seen today from satellite imagery.";
