    rdfs:label "Eupatoria/Magnopolis";
    rdfs:comment "Eupatoria/Magnopolis was a Hellenistic city of Pontus in Asia Minor founded initially by Mithridates VI Eupator in the valley of Phanaroea, near the confluence of the Lykos and Iris rivers. Cnaeus Pompeius re-founded the city as Magnopolis.";
