<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/86063778%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Unnamed fortification near Djaafra, Algeria";
    rdfs:comment "Remains of an ancient fortification of Roman date, recorded by Gsell (AAA, whence BAtlas). The location should lie within a kilometer of the BAtlas coordinates: a point along the modern CW 43 road to the east of Djaafra and just past the intersection with the road linking Ouchanene Kebira and Tiâroussine (Bordj Bou Arreridj willaya, Algeria).";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/86063778> .

