<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/874373%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Erzurum";
    rdfs:comment "Erzurum is a modern city in eastern Turkey with antecedents at least as early as the Urartian period. In late Roman times, the settlement was known as Theodosiopolis. A medieval fortress (Erzurum Kale) occupies a prominent hill in the modern city center.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/874373> .

