<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/876619726%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Theatre of Apollonia";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/373732%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The theatre of the ancient city of Apollonia, situated just outside the city wall, on the east side. The construction appears to be late Hellenistic, with half of the seats cut out of the rock on the elevation of the acropolis, and the other half built up.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/876619726> .

