<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/876875509%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Tell es-Sawwan";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/912964%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "A tell located along the Tigris River where human occupation began in the fifth millennium BCE. The site's material remains are chiefly associated with Ubaid, Hassuna, and Samarra cultures.";
