    rdfs:label "Masseria Muro";
    rdfs:comment "Masseria Muro (comune di Mesagne, province of Brindisi, south Italy) is the findspot of a hoard of ancient coins. In 1976, a deposit of coins originating from a number of Greek cities of south Italy was discovered. The coins range in date from the Archaic to the Hellenistic periods.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/887641829> .

