<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/889522884%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Gimtu";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/660988416%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Gath, Gat, or Geth (Hebrew: גַּת)) is mentioned in the El-Amarna letters as Gimti/Gintu/Gimtu. It was one of the five Philistine city-states. The town is mentioned in Neo-Assyrian sources; the modern site is Tel es-Safī.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/889522884> .

