    rdfs:label "Arrapha/Karkha de Beth Seluk";
    rdfs:comment "The name of the ancient city of Arrapha is first attested in the time of the Neo-Sumerian empire. It later became part of the Akkadian empire. Its location is thought to be that of modern Kirkuk in northeastern Iraq.";
