<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/893977%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Cutha";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/154202833%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/213534096%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Kutha or Cutha (modern Tell Ibrahim) is located on the Upper Euphrates, north of Nippur and northeast of Babylon. The archaeological site consists of two tells. Archaeological evidence of the Neo-Babylonian period has been revealed by excavation.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/893977> .

