    dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jbecker>;
    dcterms:description "The so-called Arch of Caligula has been referred to by various names and is unlikely to be connected with the emperor Caius. It is located near the intersection of the Via di Mercurio with Via delle Terme and Via della Fortuna.";
