    dcterms:contributor <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jbecker>;
    dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/thomase>;
    dcterms:description "A valley and associated region extending to the north northeast from Aqaba in southern Jordan. It served as a travel corridor in antiquity and has been the subject of intensive archaeological survey. It contains a number of documented sites, roadways, and water-management features.";
